        "id": "condition-1",
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "code": {
          "text": "Motion sickness"
        },
        "clinicalStatus": {
          "coding": [
            {
              "system": "http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/condition-clinical",
              "code": "active"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-1",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-1",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Symptoms during car travel"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports nausea, mild spinning or lightheaded sensation, and cold sweats when travelling as a passenger in a car, especially on winding roads. Describes a long-standing tendency to feel unwell during travel; onset is uncertain."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-2",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-2",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Factors affecting travel-related symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Symptoms are worse when reading or using a phone in a moving car, and improve when looking at the horizon, sitting in the front passenger seat, or when the car stops."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-3",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-3",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Symptoms during flights"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports that flights sometimes cause nausea, especially during take-off or landing."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-4",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-4",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Vomiting during car travel"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Has vomited in a car a couple of times; timing uncertain, described as possibly last month or the time before."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-5",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-5",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Vertigo and other symptoms at rest"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "No symptoms at rest and no persistent vertigo at rest. Denies true room-spinning at rest and vertigo when rolling over in bed or with quick head turns. Currently asymptomatic at rest during the call."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-6",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-6",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Associated neurologic and auditory symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Denies hearing loss, tinnitus, aural fullness, focal neurologic symptoms, diplopia, dysarthria, limb weakness, facial droop, visual loss, dysphagia, gait disturbance, numbness, paraesthesia, blackout episodes, and seizures."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-7",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-7",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Other reported negative symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Denies chest pain, shortness of breath, palpitations, syncope, sudden severe headache, fever, ear pain, ear discharge, recent upper respiratory infection, sinus symptoms, abdominal pain, and altered bowel habit. No anxiety or depression symptoms reported today."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-8",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-8",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Headache history"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports a history of 'bad headaches' in high school and intermittent 'bad headaches' with nausea; unsure whether the earlier headaches were migraines, and the headache pattern was not clear from today's history."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-9",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-9",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Telehealth examination: speech and voice"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Speaking in full sentences; voice strong. Speech fluent with no slurring audible."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-10",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-10",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Telehealth examination: affect and breathing"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Affect appropriate and coherent. No audible cough or wheeze; no shortness of breath noted over the phone."
      }
    },
    {
